  entry
    definition "(of a scale or mode) having half steps between the third and fourth degrees and the seventh and eighth degrees"
    examples ("major scales" "the key of D major")
    id oewn-01475013-a
    partOfSpeech a
  entry
    definition "of greater seriousness or danger"
